<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<usx version="2.0">
  <book code="LAM" style="id">Kahlate</book>
  <para style="h">Kahlate</para>
  <para style="toc1">Kahlate</para>
  <para style="toc2">Kahlate</para>
  <para style="mt">Kahlate</para>
  <chapter number="1" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Khopi mite a dimsek, bangchidan a lungzuang a tu maimah ahia! bangchidan a meithai bang a hongom maimah ahia! namte lak a thupi sek a, bialte lak a lalnu sek, bangchidan a sikha suak ahia!
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Zan in nakpitak in a kap a, a khituite a biang ah a om: a itte tengteng lak ah amah nem ding kuamah a neikei a: a lawmte tengteng a tung ah lepchiahtak in a gamta ua, a melmate a honghi uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Gimthuakna ziak leh, saltanna thupi ziak in. Judah saltanna ah a paita hi; khovel mite lak ah a teng a, tawldamna a mu kei: mun kawchik ahte amah sawi tengteng in a pha uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Kikhopna thupi a kuamah a hongpai louh ziak un. Zion lampite’n a sun ua; a kongpite tengteng loih in a om a, a siampute a thum huthut uh: a nungak siangthoute gimthuak in a om ua, amah mah haksa thuak in a om hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />A melmate lupen a honghi a galte a lohching uh; a tatlekna tamluat ziak in Toupa’n lah amah gim a thuaksak ngal a: gal ma ah a ta tuailaite saltanna ah a pai uh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Zion tate a pan in kilawmna tengteng a pai mangta; a lalte loupa hing mulou zuktalte bang ahi ua, a delhmi ma ah hatna neilou in a pai uh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />A gimthuak ni leh a haksat ni’n Jerusalem in nidanglai a kipan a om khinsa a thil nuamte tengteng a theigige a: gal khut a mite a puklai un, amah kuamah in a panpih kei, galte’n amah a mu ua, a siatna ah a nuihsan uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Nakpitak in Jerusalem in thil a hihkhial a; huaiziak in thil nin bang in a hongom hi: a vuaktanna a muh ziak un, amah zahte’n a musit ua, ahi, a nak huthut a, nunglam ah a kiheita hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />A nitna a nik ah a om a; a beina nanung a theigige kei; huaiziak in lamdangtak in a hong kun a; lungmuanmi a neikei hi: ngai in, Aw Toupa , ka gimthuakna; melmapa a kiliansak hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Gal in amahnu gou manphate tengteng tung ah a khut a zak a: a munsiangthou sung ah khovelmi a honglut chih a mu ngal a, na kikhopna uah amau a hong lutlouh ding uh ahi chi a thu na piak.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />A mite tengteng a nak huhu ua, tanghou a zong ua; kha hihhalh ding in a thilnuamte uh sa khenna ding in a pia ua: Thei inla, Aw Toupa , en in ka hong buah ziak in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Nou ding a bangmahlou ahi maw, nou hon paisuaksante tengteng? Ngai unla, en un, ka tung a hih a om ka lungkhamna bang lungkhamna himhim a om hiam? A heh mahmah lai a Toupa’n a hon hihgimna bang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Tung sang a kipan in ka guhte ah mei a honsawl a, amaute a zou a: ka khe a ding in len a zak a, a hon nung heisan; segawp leh nitum a bah in a hon bawlta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Ka tatleknate hakkol a khut a khih in a om a; phial khawm in a om ua, ka ngawngzang ah a hongtung ua; ka hatna a vuaksuak sak: amau ka dou zohlouhte, a khut uah Toupa’n kei a honpia hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Ka lak a ka mi hatte Toupa’n bangmahlou in a omsak; ka tangvalte mekgawpna ding in ka siatna ding in aman kikhawmpi poimawh a sam a: uain sukna bang in Toupa’n Judah tanu siangthou a sikdenta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Hiai thilte ziak in ka kap a; ka mit tui in a tuma; lungmuan ding ka kha hihhalh ding kei a pan a gamla ngal a; melma a vualzoh ziak in, ka tate amau kia a nutsiat in a om uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Zion in a khutte a zak khia a; amah lungmuan ding kuamah a omkei uh; Toupa’n Jakob tungthu ah thu a pia a, huchi a a kimvel a omte a galte a hong hihna ding un: Jerusalem a lak uah thilnin bang in a om hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Toupa a diktat a: a thupiak ka helsan ua; Za un, k’on ngen hi, nou mite tengteng, ka lungkhamna en un: ka nungak siangthoute leh ka tangvalte saltanna ah a pai uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Ka itte ka sam a, himahleh a honkhem uh: ka siampute leh ka upate’n amau khate hihhalh ding a an a kizon lai un khopi sung ah a sihloh uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Aw Toupa , ngai in; ka dah ua; ka lungsim a mangbang a; ka sung ah ka lungtang a kilumlet a; nakpitak in ka helta ua: pawlam ah namsau thah in inn sung ah sihna a om hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Ka thum a za ua: kuamah hon khamuan ding a omkei uh; ka mangbatna ka melmate tengteng in a za ua, na hihziakin a kipak uh: na phuan khiaksa ni na tun ding a, kei bang ahi ding uh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />A gitlouhna tengteng uh na ma ah hongtung hen: ka tatlekna tengteng ziak a ka tung a na hih bang in amau tung ah leng hih in: ka thumna lah a tam a, ka lungtang leng a bahta hi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="2" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Bangchidan a Toupa’n a hehna a Zion tanu meipi a tuam ahia! Israel kilawmna van a kipan lei ah a paikheta a, a hehni in a khengakna a theigige kei hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Jakob tenna tengteng Toupa’n a nawmvalh a a hehpih kei; a hehna ah Judah tanu kulh hatte a laichim a, lei toh kilual in a koih hi; gam leh huai a vaihawmte a hihninta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />A heh mahmahna ah Israel ki tengteng a sat tan; melma ma a kipan a khut taklam a la kikta: mei kuang, kimvel hulbei bang in Jakob a kang beita hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Melma bang in a thalpeu a lai a, gal bang in a khut taklam toh a ding, mit a ding a etnop huaite tengteng a that: Zion tanu puanin ah mei bang in a thangpaihna a sungbua hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Toupa melma bang a honghi, Israel a nawmvalhta; a Innpi tengteng a nawmvalh vek a, a kulh muanhuaite a hihseta: Judah tanu ah sunna leh kahna a pungsak hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Huan hileh kilawm bang in, a biakbuk hiamgamtakin a lamang a; a kikhopna mun a hihseta: Toupa’n kikhawm thupi leh khawlni Zion ah mangngilh in a omsak a, a hehna thangpaihna in kumpipa leh siampu a musit hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Toupa’n a maitam a paimang a, a munsiangthou a kih a, a Inpi kulhbangte melmate khut ah a peta hi: kikhop thupi ni bang in Toupa inn sung ah belam a bawl uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Zion tanu kulhbang Toupa’n suksiat a tumta; a khauzan a, suse lou din a khut a lakei hi: himahleh leichian leh kulhbang a kapsak a; a kigawp tuak uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />A kongpite lei ah a tum ua; a kalhna chiangte hihsia in a kuaitan hi: dan omlouhna namte lak ah a kumpipa leh a lalte a om uh; ahi, a zawlneite’n Toupa a kipan meng a mu kei uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Zion tanu upate leitung ah a tu ua, a pau kei uh; a luzang ua leivui a khi ua; saiip puan a silh uhi: Jerusalem nungak siangthoute’n lei lam ah a lu uh a kun uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Khitui in ka mitte a zuau a, ka lungsim a mangbang hi, leitung ah ka sin buakkhiak in a om a, ka mite tanu siatna ziak in khopi kongzingte a naupang tuailaite leh nawi nelaite a sihbup ziak un.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />A nute uh kiang ah, buh leh bal leh uain kaw om ahia? a chi ua. Khopi kongzingte miliamte bang a a sihbup lai un, a nute uh angsung a a kha uh sun buak a a omlai in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Na kiang ah bang ka theisak dia? Nang toh bang ka teh dia, Aw Jerusalem tanu? Aw Zion tanu siangthou, k’on lungmuan theihna ding in, bang toh k’on kikim sak dia? Na siatna lah tuipi bang in a thupi ngal a: kuan nang a hon hihdam thei dia?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Na zawlneite’n bangmahlou leh haina nang ading in mengmuh in a mu ua; na koltanna pinawn ding in, na gitlouhna a mukhe kei uh: himahleh bangmahlou puakgik leh pimang a omna ziakte nang honmuh sak uh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Honpai kheng tengteng in nang a khut uh a hon betkhum ua; Jerusalem tanu a kikou khum ua; a lu uh a sinkhum uh, hiai khopi kilawmna bukim, lei tengteng a nuamsakna, a chih uh ahi maw? achi uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Nang siatna ding in na melmate tengteng in a kam uh lianpiin a ka ua: hiai ni i ngakngak uh ahi mahmah hi; i mukheta a, i muta uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Toupa’n a lunggel a hih tangtungta nidanglai a a thupiak a hih tangtung a; a paita, a hehpih kei: na tung a melma a kipaksak a, na galte ki a tawisangta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Toupa kiang ah a lungtang a kikou a: Aw Zion tanu kulhbang, sun leh zan in khitui luipi bang in luangsak in; khawl kipe kenla; na mit khawlsak ken.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Thou in, zan in kikou in, zanvente kipatna ah; Toupa mai ah tui bang in na lungtang sungkhia in; na ta tuailaite hinna ading in amah lam ah na khutte liktou in, kongzingte ah anngawl in a bahgawp uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Aw Toupa , en inla, ngai in, hichibang a na hihna; numeite’n a gah uh a ne ding uam, khut a awih a om naupangte? Toupa munsiangthou sung ah siampu leh zawlnei thah a om ding uh hia?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Kongzingte ah leitung ah tuailaite leh putek a lum ua; namsau in ka nungak siangthoute leh ka tangvalte a puk uh: na heh ni’n amaute na that a; na that a, na hehpih kei hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Kikhawmpi thupi lai bang in, munchih ah a unaute na sam a, Toupa heh ni’n kuamah suakta hiam, om hiam a omkei: huai ka dontei a ka khoilette ka melma in a negaita hi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="3" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />A hehna chiang a gimthuakna mu mipa ka hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Khovak ah hilou in khomial ah aman a honpi a, a honvak sak.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Nitum in ka siatna ding in a khut a hei a hei petmah hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Ka sa leh ka vun a upa sak a; ka guhte a kitansak hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Ka siatna ding a lam a, khatna leh nauveina in a hon umsuak hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Sawtpi a sisate bang in, mun mialte ah a hon tengsak hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Ka pawt khiak theihlouhna ding in, ka kimvel in dai a kai a, ka khainiang a gik hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Ahi, ka kah a, panpihna ka nget lai in, ka thumna a daltan hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Suangsek in ka lampite dai a kaitou a, ka lam zuihte a kawisak hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Kei ding in amah vompi mibuk leh mun guk a humpinelkai bang ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Ka lampite a kaihei a, a hon botnen a; a hon bawlgawp hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />A thalpeu a lai a, a thal adia ngim ding in kei a honbawl hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />A thalbawm a thalte ka lungtang ah a lutsak a,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Ka mite tengteng nuihsat ka honghi a; ni tumtum a a la uh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Hehna in a hon dimsak ua, gamsai in a honvak uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Suangtat in ka hate leng a kitamsak a, vut in a hontuam hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Muanna a kipan gamlapi ah ka kha na suan a; hauhsakna ka mangngilhta.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Ka hatna a mang a, Toupa a kipan ka lametna, ka chi a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Ka gimthuakna leh ka haksatna, gamsai leh khatna theigige in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Ka kha in amaute a theigige a, ka sung ah a kun ngiungiau hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Hiai ka thei thak a, huaiziak in lametna ka nei hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Toupa chitnate ziak ahi hihmang a i omlouh uh, a lainatnate a zuau ngeilouh ziak in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Zingsang teng in a thak zel ua; na ginomna a thupi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Toupa ka tantuan ahi, ka kha in a chi; huaiziak in amah lametna ka nei ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Amah ngakte kiang ah Toupa a hoih, amah zong mi tung ah.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Min Toupa hotdamna a lamet a a ngak vengveng a hoih hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Min a tuailaia hakkol a puak amah ading in a hoih ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />Amah tung a a ngaktak ziak in, tangtut henla, dai sipsip hen.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />Leivui ah a kam koih hen; huchi a lametna a om theihna ding in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" />Amah bengpa kiang ah a biang doh hen; kouna in amah dim vum hen.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" />Toupa’n lah tangtawn in a delh kei ding a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" />Dahna suaksak mahleh, a chitna tamdan dungzui in lainatna a nei ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" />Kilawptakin mite tate a hihgim hiam a lungkhamsak ahi kei hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" />Lei a suangkulh tangte tengteng khenuai sik kham ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" />Tungnung Pen maima a mihing thuneihna kaihei ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" />A thu a mihing bawlsiat, Toupa’n pha a sa kei.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" />Toupa’n thu a piaklouh in, hichi a honghi, chi kua ahia?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" />Tungnung Pen kam a kipan in hoihlou leh hoih a hongpai kei maw?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" />Bangding a mihing, a khelhna gawtna ading a mi phun ahia?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" />I lampite zong in enchian ni, Toupa lam ah kiknawn ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" />Vante a Pathian kiang ah i lungtang leh i khutte liktou ni:
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="42" style="v" />Ka tatlek ua ka hel uh; na ngaidam kei hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="43" style="v" />Hehna in na khuh a, kou n’on delh a, that in, na hehpih kei hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="44" style="v" />Meipi in na kituam a, huchi a ka thumna in a pailet louhna ding in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="45" style="v" />Mite lak ah deihlouh leh ninneng bang in n’on bawl a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="46" style="v" />Ka siatna ding in ka melma tengteng un a kam uh lianpi in a ka uh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="47" style="v" />Launa leh kawkhuk ka tung uah a hong tung a, siatgawpna leh siatna.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="48" style="v" />Ka mite tanu suksiatna ziak in, ka mit tui in a tum hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="49" style="v" />Khawllou in, ka mit in a buak a, a khawl kei hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="50" style="v" />Van a kipan a Toupa’n a etsuk a, a muh matan
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="51" style="v" />Ka khopi tanute tengteng ziak in ka mit in ka kha a dah sak.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="52" style="v" />Vasa bang in hondelh bah ua, a ziak bei a ka melma hite’n.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="53" style="v" />Leikawhawm sung ah ka hinna a sattat ua, ka tung ah suang a khia uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="54" style="v" />Ka lutung ah tuite a luang a; satkhiak in ka om, ka chi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="55" style="v" />Aw Toupa , leikawhawm niampen apan in, na min ka sam hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="56" style="v" />Ka aw na za a; ka kahna ah, ka nakna ah na bil sel ken.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="57" style="v" />Nang ka honsap ni’n n’ong pai nai a: Lau ken, na chi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="58" style="v" />Aw Toupa , ka kha thu n’on gensak a; ka hinna na tanta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="59" style="v" />Aw Toupa , ka diklouhna na mu a, ka thu ngaihtuah in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="60" style="v" />Ka tung a a phulakna tengteng uleh a thusawm tengteng uh na muta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="61" style="v" />A kouna uh na za a, Aw Toupa , ka siatna ding a a thusawm tengteng uh;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="62" style="v" />Ka siatna ding a dingte mukte leh, nitum a ka siatna ding a a ngaihtuahna uh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="63" style="v" />A tut uleh adin touh uh nang en in; a la uh ka hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="64" style="v" />Aw Toupa , a khut nasep dungzui in, a tung uah thuk in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="65" style="v" />Lungtang sakna amau pia inla, a tung ua na hamsia.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="66" style="v" />Heh in amau na delh ding a Toupa vante nuai a kipan amaute na hihgawp ding hi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="4" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Bangchidan a dangkaeng mial ahia! Bangchidan a dangkaeng siangthou pen lamdangta ahia! Munsiangthou a suangte kongzingte ah sunkhiak ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Zion tapa manphate, dangkaeng hoih toh teh theih, bangchidan a leibel, belvelmi khutsuak bang a ngaih hi ahia!
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Sehalte nasan in a nawi uh a suah ua, a ta tuailaite uh a tepsak uh: ka mite tanu zaw hong gilou a, gamdai vasa mulneilou bang in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Nawitep lai naupang lei dangtak ziak in a lei a kam dangtawng ah a belh a: naupang tuailaite’n tanghou a ngen ua, kuamah in amau di’n a balkham kei uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Nuamtak a nete kongzing ah a mangthang ua: puansandup a khangliante’n ekvum a koi uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Ka mite tanu gitlouhna gawtna Sodom khelhna gawtna sang in a thupizaw a, huai bel mitphiat kallou in a kizou a, amah tung ah khut a kinga kei hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />A miliante vuk sang in a siangthou zaw ua, nawitui sang in a ngou zaw uh, rubi sandup sang in a pum uh a sandup zaw ua, a tetna uh sapphir suangmantam bang ahi:
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />A mel uh suangkuangthei sang in a vomzaw a: kongzing a theih in a om kei uh: a vun uh a guh uah a belh bikbek a; a keu a, chiangkang a bang hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Namsau a thah a om dingte kial a thah a om dingte sang in a hoihzaw uh; gam a gahte duh ziak in hiaite lah a gawng gawp un, nakpi’n a sia uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Hehpihthei numeite khut in a tate uh huan in, ka tanute hihsia in a ne uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Toupa’n a thangpaihna a hih pichingta, a hehna a sungkhia a; Zion ah mei a toh a, huai in a suangphumte a suse vek hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Lei a Kumpipate leh khovel a mi tengteng in leng, Jerusalem kongpiah gal leh melma a lut ding uh chih.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />A zawlneite khelhna ziak leh a siampute ginatlouhna ziak ahi, huchibang a a laktak a midikte sisan suah a a om.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Mittaw mite bang in kongzing ah a vakvai ua, sisan a suknit in a om ua, mite’n a puante uh a lawng kei uh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Paimang un, Nin! paimang un, paimang un, honlawng kei un, chi in amau a kikou khum ua: a taimang ua, a vialvak lai un, mite’n namte lak ah, hiai ah a om nawn kei ding uh, a chi uh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Toupa hehna in amaute a hawmzak a; amaute a limsak nawnta kei ding: Siampute min a zahtak kei ua, upate a deihsak kei uh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Koute mitte vaigawp a, huhna mulou a: lametna i ngak uah nam hon hondam theilou ding i ngakta uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />I kongzingte ua i pai theihlouh na ding in, i kalsuante a zong ua: i tawp uh a nai a, i nite a kimta: i tawp uh lah a hongtungta.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Van a muvanlaite sang in ei hon delhte a kin zaw uh: mualtung ah hon delh ua, gamdai ah a hon na buk uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />I nakvangte a hu, Toupa thaunilh, a kawkhuk ua lak in a om ua; amah thu gen in. A lim nuai a namte lak ah i hing ding, i chi uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Nuamsa inla kipak in Aw Edom tanu, Uz gam a teng: nou lah nang pha in leng a hongpai suak ding; na kham ding a vuaktang in na kibawl ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Aw Zion tanu, na thulimlouhna gawtna zoh ahita; saltanna ah nang a hon pimang nawn kei ding: na thulimlouhna in a hongveh ding, Aw Edom tanu; na khelhnate a mukhe ding hi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="5" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Theigige in, Aw Toupa , ka tung ua hongtung: a hon kouna uh en in, mu in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Ka gouluah uh mikhual kiang a hei ahi a, ka innte uh gamdang mite lam ah.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Tagah leh pabei ka hi ua, ka nute uh meithai bang ahi uh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Ka tuidawn ding uh sum in ka lei ua; ka singte uh kou lak a zuak in a om hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />A hondelhte ka ngawngzang uah a om ua, ka bah ua, khawlna ka neikei uh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Aiguptate leh Assuriate kiang ah, Tanghou a lungkim ding in ka kipia uh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Ka pipute uh a khial ua, a omkei uh; a gitlouhna uh kou ka pua uh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Sikhate’n ka tung uah vai a hawm ua: a khut ua kipan a kou hon tankhe ding kuamah a omkei uh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Ka hinna uh lauthawnna toh ka tanghou uh ka mu ua gamdai namsau ziak in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Thuk bang in ka vun uh a vom a nakpitak a kialna ziak in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Zion a numeite a sual ua, Judah khopite a nungakte.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />A khut un lalte khailup in a om ua, upa melte zahtak in a omkei hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Tangvalte’n khawl a pua ua, naupangte singnuai ah a kisui uh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Kongpi a kipan upate a khawl ua, a lasakna ua kipan in Tangvalte a khawl uh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Ka lungtang kipahna uh a tawp a, ka lamna uh dahna a suak hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Ka lu ua kipan ka lallukhu uh a kia a, ka tung uh a gik hi! ka khelh ziak un.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Hiai ziak in ka lungtang uh a bah a; hiai thilte ziak in ka mitte uh a mial hi;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Hihsiat a om, Zion mual ziak in; sehalte a tung ah a vak uh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Aw Toupa , nang tangtawn in na om gige; na mangtutphah khang khat a kipan in khang khat tan in a om hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Bangdia tangtawn a hon mangngilh a, hichi tantan hon nungngatsan na hia?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Nang lam hon ngasak in, Aw Toupa huchi in bawlhoih nawn in ka om ding uh; nidanglai bang in ka nite uh thaksak in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Ahihkeileh n’on paikhe hilhial ahia? Ka tung uah na heh mahmah ahia?
  </para>
</usx>
